stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> PATROL

    PATROL --> DETECT: target acquired; detection needed
    PATROL --> CHASE: immediate promotion (mode-specific)
    DETECT --> CHASE: detection confirmed
    DETECT --> PATROL: target lost / meter decayed

    CHASE --> ATTACK: target visible and in range
    CHASE --> SEARCH: visual-loss grace expired
    CHASE --> PATROL: target invalid; no replacement
    ATTACK --> RECOVER: attack episode finishes

    RECOVER --> CHASE: eligible target visible
    RECOVER --> SEARCH: remembered target position
    RECOVER --> PATROL: no valid target
    SEARCH --> CHASE: visible target reacquired
    SEARCH --> PATROL: search ended / timed out
